  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to REPOA a preeminent research institution in Tanzania working on capacity buiding and evidence based research for policy development. It is aligned to the Mission strategy around supporting research and adaptive programmes to generaret evidence on effective approaches to socio- economic transformation. Under this outcome REPOA will focus on three strategic research themes including: Economic Resilience, Competitiveness, and Inclusive Growth; Inclusive Governance and Citizen Participation for Sustainable Development; and Inequality, vulnerability and women&#x2019;s empowerment. A core funding agreement alomgside Denmark, Sweden and Norway.</narrative>
  </description>
